window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The third novel in </b><b><i>USA Today</i></b><b> bestselling author Penelope Bloom's Anyone But...series sizzles with a sexy and hilarious story about letting go of the past to chase the love of a lifetime.</b></p> <p>Seven years ago, I swore I'd never date Nick King. Ever.</p> <p>Now I'm supposed to work under him - and <i>no</i>, despite the way he glares like he wants to strip me bare, I mean he'll be my boss. But what better way to prove I'm really over him, right?</p> <p>I was a nerdy overachiever in high school, and Nick was my hopeless crush. I even laminated a note he passed to me; granted, I had a thing for laminators, but that's beside the point.</p> <p>Now, my only shot at getting my life back on track is to crawl to him on my knees and pray I nail the interview. Maybe I should pray that's the only thing that gets nailed in his office - especially since he looks like he wants to devour me.</p> <p>Nick broke my heart once. But hey, I'm still pretty handy with a laminator. Maybe I could run my heart through one before I take this job.</p>"; 
